{"words": [{"text": "صِبْغَةَ", "translation": "(The) color (religion)"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَنْ", "translation": "And who"}, {"text": "أَحْسَنُ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "than"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "صِبْغَةًۭ ۖ", "translation": "at coloring"}, {"text": "وَنَحْنُ", "translation": "And we"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to Him"}, {"text": "عَـٰبِدُونَ", "translation": "(are) worshippers"}], "sahih": "[And say, \"Ours is] the religion of Allāh. And who is better than Allāh in [ordaining] religion? And we are worshippers of Him.\""}